Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.31,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, manager Kosuke! {really hate that Kosuke-onii-chan - meaning he's like a big brother to them besides being the dorm manager but alas, this is not 2001}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.31,0:00:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Morning, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.61,0:00:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a hand with anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.63,0:01:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one more day, huh? {until his aunt returns from HK to take over the dorm for him}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm beat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.87,0:03:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nimura-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.80,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A little stiff, I feel?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.92,0:03:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanzaki, did you over-exercise again?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.38,0:03:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.30,0:03:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannonball!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your act together!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.15,0:03:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you not to jump \Ninto the tub without washing off first?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.22,0:03:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But washing it off is such a chore! {???????? datte nagasu no ******}{mendouchii? like mendoukusai}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.61,0:03:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You stop right now! {???}{hora matte}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.33,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwu! Chika-bu, help me! {??? idk why she calls her that}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Help... {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.81,0:03:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.70,0:03:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan, that kitty has to die! \NI won't let it go today! {????????????????? what kind of fucking retard did sound mastering on this ova where every SFX has to drown out the speech completely}{チカちゃんそん猫が死せん，今日こそ許さん}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.59,0:03:54.55,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Snug, snug... scritch, scritch. {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.60,0:04:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, wasn't me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.39,0:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanzaki, some of us are still sleeping. {since it's the morning, doesn't make sense for it for her to be trying to sleep}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.08,0:04:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit making a racket already.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nimura-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.74,0:04:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.91,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.66,0:04:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... wait! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.45,0:04:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.19,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You liked that, Kanzaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.83,0:04:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous... aah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.94,0:04:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Mayu{-onee-chan - because "big sister mayu" would look just as ridiculous; also full name is Mayuki Nimura}! \NManager Kosuke's stiff in place! {literally "hard"}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.38,0:04:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? \NKosuke's getting all stiff?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,T-That's not...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.39,0:04:40.84,Thought,,0,0,0,,Though, in this position...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.64,0:04:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I look down carelessly...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.02,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.32,0:04:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.23,0:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nimura-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.97,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's not like \Nthey'll deflate{減らす} if I touch 'em a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.10,0:05:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.41,0:05:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-san, you should \Nget dressed after taking a bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.31,0:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.17,0:05:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.13,0:05:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it is April, \Nwalking around naked isn't exactly a good idea...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You could catch a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.65,0:05:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Colds are hard to shake this time of year. {??? idk why}\NYou should be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.53,0:05:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan isn't eating again today?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave her alone. \NShe says she's not hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.41,0:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her be. If you spoil her, \Nshe'll just take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.46,0:05:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But ever since I got here, \Nshe hasn't sat down at the table even once.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.45,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because she doesn't want to.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.14,0:06:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan, aren't you having breakfast?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.07,0:06:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I'm not hungry! \NLet's go, Kotora, Jiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.36,0:06:19.21,Thought,,0,0,0,,It all started when my relative, Aunt Kanna,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.21,0:06:25.08,Thought,,0,0,0,,asked me to fill in as the dorm manager \Nwhile she was away on a trip over spring break.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.51,0:06:30.56,Thought,,0,0,0,,I've been here a little over ten days now, and every day has been one uproar after another, just like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.56,0:06:33.73,Thought,,0,0,0,,It's nice having what feels \Nlike a bunch of little sisters...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.73,0:06:37.70,Thought,,0,0,0,,but for some reason \NMio-chan just can't stand me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.96,Thought,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's my last day working here.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.96,0:06:44.36,Thought,,0,0,0,,I just wish she'd at least eat \None of my meals before I leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.03,0:07:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! The cherry blossoms are in full bloom today.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.93,0:07:24.80,Thought,,0,0,0,,H-How careless of her... {lack of vigilance/caution}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.80,0:07:27.80,Thought,,0,0,0,,W-With a young man around and all...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.23,0:07:38.58,Thought,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.58,0:07:41.26,Thought,,0,0,0,,Oh crap. What the heck am I thinking?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.26,0:07:45.03,Thought,,0,0,0,,All right. Back to work...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.41,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... she smells good. {love the smell of fresh manko in the morning}{:TRUE:}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.37,0:07:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.42,0:07:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.40,0:07:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.87,0:08:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... no... I was just thinking \Nthere was still laundry left to do...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.47,0:08:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.35,0:08:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself! {whhat's that}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.61,0:08:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hilarious! You're the only one who'd actually get hurt by Ai! {??? fuck it I'm not gonna bother marking lines I'm not sure about anymore, this is pure hell}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.86,0:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, that bandage is kind of cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.33,0:08:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on, anyway? {something about ai?}{fuck whoever mixed this OVA}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.47,0:08:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.39,0:08:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone making a midnight snack?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.22,0:08:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If they'd asked me, I'd have made it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.31,0:08:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwu... Chika-bu, you're my lifesaver.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.07,0:09:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were so hungry, \Nwhy didn't you eat with everyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.48,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.55,0:09:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.41,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't eat that guy's cooking.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.95,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Kosuke's a nice guy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's kind, and he's a great cook.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.69,0:09:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about whether he's nice or a good cook.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.09,0:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something Chika-bu could never understand!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.76,0:09:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? Mio-chan, we're best friends, aren't we? You can't even tell me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.85,0:09:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me. Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.35,0:09:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.19,0:09:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the one thing I can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.02,0:09:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mio-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.22,0:09:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-bu, that egg pilaf was delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.99,0:09:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely repay you for it someday!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.48,0:10:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.82,0:10:12.42,Thought,,0,0,0,,Today's my last day here...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.52,0:10:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.74,0:10:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Can I help?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.74,0:10:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... There's something I'd like \Nto ask your advice about.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.62,0:10:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.80,0:10:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry it's such a mess.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.15,0:10:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.39,0:10:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually quite nice and tidy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.44,0:10:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.06,0:10:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.88,0:10:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mio-chan's gym uniform. \NI'm sewing on her new class name tag.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.52,0:10:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. School starts again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.39,0:11:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about Mio-chan, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.49,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Why won't Mio-chan eat my cooking?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.11,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan came here when she was just a newborn.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.44,0:11:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Back before everyone else was living here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.99,0:11:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The previous dorm manager, \NKeigo-san,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.12,0:11:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,found Mio-chan abandoned on the doorstep.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.06,0:11:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.75,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,From then on, Mio-chan and Keigo-san were always together, just like a real family.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.21,0:11:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was happy too — \Nit felt like I'd gained a little sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.97,0:11:39.72,Thought,,0,0,0,,A-Ai-san doesn't have any family...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.48,0:11:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Mio-chan was five,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.60,0:11:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Keigo-san had to leave for overseas.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.57,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So he had to leave Mio-chan behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.52,0:11:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He told her he'd definitely come back \Nand that she should wait here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.49,0:12:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He promised that \Nthey'd be together again forever when he returned.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.18,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt so sorry for Mio-chan back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.06,0:12:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that when I'm here, Mio-chan, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.90,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,she feels like I'm trying to take Keigo-san's place?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.55,0:12:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the food!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.63,0:12:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.10,0:12:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Keigo-san's specialty fish dish.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.06,0:12:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... you think she might eat that?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.25,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I remember it. Um... let's see...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.66,0:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it was white, sliced up, and grilled...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.80,0:12:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-san, that's not much to go on. \NAnything more distinctive?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.20,0:12:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... it had sauce on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.74,0:12:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sauce? What color was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Red.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Red?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.10,0:12:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomato sauce?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.00,0:12:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Yes! Tomatoes!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.62,0:12:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pan-fried white fish saute or meunière \Nwith tomato sauce...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can make that.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.52,0:12:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.43,0:13:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.35,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.22,0:13:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to buy all of this?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.69,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All of it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.04,0:13:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect, don't you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.17,0:13:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go buy the ingredients \Nfor Keigo-san's recipe together.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.79,0:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.74,0:13:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. \NBack to your stations.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.39,0:13:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.91,0:13:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then... maybe I'll take another nap.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.96,0:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding. Just kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.38,0:13:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? Are you really?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.37,0:13:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Obviously I was kidding!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.14,0:13:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Spare me! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.06,0:13:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up are Mayuki-san's art supplies.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.82,0:13:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ai-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Ai-chan, is that your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.50,0:13:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, would ya look at that , \Nisn't it the guy from Sazanami Dorm?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.79,0:14:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.44,0:14:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to show a little more \Nsex appeal too, Ai-chan. {she's the actual owner of the dorm}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.40,0:14:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking care of Sazanami's \Nall well and good, but you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.67,0:14:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine. I'm doing it because I want to.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.65,0:14:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, what'll it be today?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.44,0:14:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... what kinds of white fish do you have?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it. We've got just about everything today.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.10,0:14:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"Is that your boyfriend?" he said.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.55,0:14:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we really look that close?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.33,0:14:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we do.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.75,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.34,0:14:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry home.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.11,0:14:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanzaki, I think that needs to go \Na little higher on the right.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.26,0:14:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, that's a little too far. \NYeah, yeah, that's about right.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.92,0:14:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis! Are we leaving this up the whole way? {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.30,0:14:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Funyan... {probably the sounds of suffering from the heat?}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.50,0:14:57.96,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Whoa! I forgot!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.92,0:15:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The cherry blossoms are beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.34,0:15:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They really are. Maybe we should have a flower-viewing party next Sunday.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.16,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... would next week be too late?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.70,0:15:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.39,0:15:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better to go cherry blossom \Nviewing sooner, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.65,0:15:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder when we should do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.48,0:15:20.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,Next week, I'll already be...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.70,0:15:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.90,0:15:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid cat girl, \Nall you do is get in my way!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.32,0:15:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow! Why can't I have this little? It's nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.03,0:15:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Something smells burnt!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.29,0:15:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek! When Kosuke comes home, \Nhe'll see this giant mess!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.18,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... Water! Water! \NSomebody bring water! Put it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.43,0:15:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nya! He's back already.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.11,0:16:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell! \NYou're home too early.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.40,0:16:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've taken your time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.46,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.33,0:16:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "what"? \NCan't you tell?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.33,0:16:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's your farewell party.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.02,0:16:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. We made a bit of a mess.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.95,0:16:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that cat...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.15,0:16:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! I wasn't the only one! \NHalf of it was Kaoru and Mayu!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.55,0:16:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.06,0:16:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.88,0:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.89,0:16:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kosuke-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.84,0:16:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah... I thought I'd gotten used to it by now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.23,0:16:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to Kosuke for two weeks of hard work!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is delicious. \NIt goes perfectly with sake.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.62,0:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.35,0:16:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These potatoes are great.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.62,0:16:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This salad too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.76,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's shungiku. {/chrysanthemum greens.}{nobody says chrysanthemum}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the cabbage has a nice sweetness to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.82,0:17:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad. It was my first time cooking for a party.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.61,0:17:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And you managed to make all this?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.86,0:17:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke really is a born cook. {koku-san}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.78,0:17:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Chika, what did you think I was before?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.51,0:17:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Errand boy. {lit: person in charge of chores}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.23,0:17:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan, aren't you going to eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.62,0:17:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.12,0:17:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-bu! Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.30,0:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one bite.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.96,0:17:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san made this especially for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.36,0:17:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.37,0:18:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.28,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Dad's...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.08,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san worked really to make it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.55,0:18:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your home too, Mio-chan. \NEveryone here is family.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.98,0:18:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan, Mayuki-san, Kaoru-san, \NIzayoi-san, Kosuke-san, and me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.41,0:18:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, Keigo-san too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.95,0:18:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all part of the Sazanami family.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.03,0:18:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as this family is here, \NKeigo-san will always have a home to come back to.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.33,0:19:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Mio-chan and all of us \Nkeep waiting for him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.02,0:19:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When Keigo-san comes back, we'll all live together again. All of us together.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.95,0:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.31,0:19:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.05,0:19:14.30,Thought,,0,0,0,,All together, huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.49,0:19:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like everybody's passed out.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.41,0:19:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, tonight's party was something else.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.31,0:19:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.81,0:19:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.73,0:19:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The cherry blossoms.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.99,0:19:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry... it's just that this is the last night.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.43,0:19:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'll be leaving...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.14,0:19:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that you came here, Kosuke-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.26,0:19:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.36,0:19:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite what I told Mio-chan earlier, maybe I'm the one here who's really wanted a family all along.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.70,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any parents or siblings.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.49,0:20:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kanna-san and then you were gone too...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.93,0:20:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd really...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.20,0:20:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back. \NI promise I'll come back!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.57,0:20:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.81,0:21:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.69,0:21:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.33,0:21:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.59,0:21:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{??? he should be asking if it's okay here}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.02,0:21:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{yeah}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.76,0:22:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.28,0:22:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:55.32,0:22:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... almost there!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.21,0:22:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.56,0:23:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sazanami Girls' Dorm.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:15.90,0:23:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna-san? \NWhat's wrong, calling this late at night?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.05,0:23:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone's doing fine. How about you, Kanna-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.35,0:23:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring break's almost over.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.94,0:23:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.42,0:23:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You scored? Scored what? {get}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.88,0:23:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A... man!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.54,0:23:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A man?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.25,0:23:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A man?!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.63,0:23:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! \NHe's absolutely perfect for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.42,0:23:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His personality, his looks, his size... {w/e she means by sizes of anything}{size of his penis, it fits perfectly in her vagina}\Neverything fits me perfectly!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.33,0:23:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost too good to be true, \Nlike he was born just for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.97,0:24:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-chan, don't get mad! \NThis is where it gets good!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.48,0:24:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you get to the point first?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.89,0:24:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,M-M-Married?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.26,0:24:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Married?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.46,0:24:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Not coming back?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.20,0:24:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What do you mean you're not coming back? \NThen what about Sazanami?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.90,0:24:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving it to Kosuke-san?! {not the ownership but the duty of looking after it}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.57,0:24:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...that's what she said. {...that's what she says}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.69,0:24:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.24,0:24:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I approve!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.82,0:24:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da! My new school uniform!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:29.51,0:24:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:30.82,0:24:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, does it look good on me?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.15,0:24:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You look adorable, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:34.42,0:24:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow! I got a new uniform too!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.72,0:24:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:37.43,0:24:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess even a cat can dress up, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:39.08,0:24:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as they say, casting gold before cats. {needed for the next line; neko ni koban (literally "gold coins to a cat") = casting pearls before swine}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:41.02,0:24:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure it's not "pearls to cats"? {?? idk why or how she turned that around and I don't care either}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.11,0:24:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:44.99,0:24:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Kaoru's uniform is new too.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:48.74,0:24:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.61,0:24:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Izayoi! Don't go saying unnecessary things.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.22,0:24:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's new about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.47,0:24:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,See? This ribbon.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.25,0:24:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a slightly brighter color now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.28,0:24:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.41,0:25:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Now that you mention it... I guess it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.32,0:25:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.14,0:25:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My, everyone's taking their \Nsweet time on the first day, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:05.62,0:25:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:07.62,0:25:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:12.12,0:25:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:14.21,0:25:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:23.62,0:25:27.90,Thought,,0,0,0,,And so, I ended up staying \Nat Sazanami Girls' Dorm.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.90,0:25:31.06,Thought,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can become part of this family too.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.52,0:26:02.46,Song,,0,0,0,,{Kaze ni Makenai Heart no Katachi by Nishimura Hina ; full lyrics: https://utaten.com/lyric/to16064644/ }I've counted all the days\NFrom sunny afternoons to starry nights
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.93,0:26:08.57,Song,,0,0,0,,Even through the saddest mornings\NYou always smiled
Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.00,0:26:14.31,Song,,0,0,0,,And gave me\NA gentle melody
Dialogue: 10,0:26:14.31,0:26:16.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart
Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.04,0:26:20.55,Song,,0,0,0,,Remember the blueness of the sky
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.21,0:26:26.62,Song,,0,0,0,,Even when your eyes fill with tears
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.62,0:26:28.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart
Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.46,0:26:40.57,Song,,0,0,0,,We made a promise with our hearts as one\NAnd we've finally made it this far
Dialogue: 10,0:26:41.17,0:26:47.37,Song,,0,0,0,,Our hearts are always sincere, always unbeatable
Dialogue: 10,0:26:47.37,0:26:53.55,Song,,0,0,0,,This feeling I hold close isn't the biggest or the strongest
Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.55,0:26:59.59,Song,,0,0,0,,But it's a heart that won't lose to the wind
Dialogue: 10,0:26:59.59,0:27:05.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Those sleepless nights I spent crying\NWill surely become my strength
Dialogue: 10,0:27:05.79,0:27:12.03,Song,,0,0,0,,That's what a heart is, absolutely unbeatable!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:09.16,0:27:11.43,Song,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H630967&}Absolutely!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:12.03,0:27:21.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's keep smiling as we walk into the wind
Dialogue: 10,0:27:21.04,0:27:29.72,Song,,0,0,0,,We won't lose! Our hearts...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:29.72,0:27:30.45,Song,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H630967&}OK!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:30.45,0:27:39.69,Song,,0,0,0,,...are unbeatable!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:37.39,0:27:39.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H630967&}(Of course they are!)
Comment: 0,0:27:39.69,0:27:42.69,Song,,0,0,0,,
